  "description": "Every ride becomes a thrilling adventure. Equipped with the powerful Yamaha PW-S2 drive, our ADVENTR 8 with 27.5″ wheels is your ticket to the world of eSUV bikes. The bike has the DNA of a classic trekking bike, including a luggage rack and a StVZO-approved lighting system. At the same time, thanks to full suspension with 140mm travel at the front and rear along with wide Continental tyres, it does not need to hide from classic eMountainbikes. And that’s not all: the 720Wh battery and the optional Range Extender transform the ADVENTR 8 into a touring world champion with maximum range, while the Modular Range System makes it easy to attach accessories such as bottles and the like. In short: this enormously versatile eBike is the perfect choice if you are looking for a partner for all your adventures – from off-road tours at the weekend to your daily rides.",
